              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bab. 25.1-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.17+2CH.36.18+2CH.36.19+2CH.36.20+2CH.36.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ke Ch. 36.17-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nga Nebukadinesa, omwami owa Babiloni ne banamae bewe boosi ne bubwami bwe sibala bubwaba asi we bunyali bwa Nebukadinesa bwoosi ne babaandu boosi baba ne balikho bapania lukoba lwa Yerusalemu ne chingoba chalwo choosi, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Yeremia ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli aloma ali, khoche olomalome khu Sedekia omwami owa Yuda mala omuboolele oli ‘Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, lola ese ndikho nja khuaana lukoba luno khu mwami owa Babiloni mala alalwosia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe se olamwibacha tawe ne kakhali ng'ali okhaambwe ne khuaanwa khu niye. Okhabonane no mwami owa Babiloni moni na moni ne khulomaloma naye mala okhache Babiloni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhaba kario Ee, Sedekia omwami owa Yuda, ulila likhuwa lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi! Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma khuloondekhana nawe ali: Ewe se okheererwe mwiie tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe okhafwe mu muleembe. Ne nga boselia bakuuka biiunya bulayi ne babasiikha ba baaba babaami ewe ne osiili khuba, akhaba ewe wesi babaandu bakhakhwoselie biiunya bulayi. Ne khu khusooma ne baloma bali ‘Ee! Omwami wefwe aafwiile!’ Sikila ese Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nalomaloome likhuwa lino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yeremia omung'oosi, aboolela Sedekia omwami owa Yuda kamakhuwa kano koosi mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siise nisio banamae bo mwami owa Babiloni baba ne balikho bapana ne babaandu be mu lukoba lwa Yerusalemu ne be mu ngoba cha Yuda choosi chichaba ne charama, chingoba cha Lakishi ne cha Aseka. Chingoba chibili chino nicho chong'ene chichaba ne charama mu Yuda khu ngoba chisire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Khukholela nasioobi ke bubeeyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami Sedekia aba akholile endakaano ne babaandu be mu Yerusalemu boosi khulangilila bulekhuule bwabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endakaano yaloma eli buli mundu enyekha alekhuule nasioobi bewe Baeburania be siseecha nende be siikhasi nio akhabao omundu yesi yesi okhola Omueburania wasie khuuba nasioobi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio babaandu ne babemeelesi babwe bafukiilila khulekhuula nasioobi babwe mala lundi bakhabakho ne nasioobi tawe. Nio bafukiilila khulekhuula nasioobi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali enyuma wako bakaluukhana mala bakobosia nasioobi babwe be siseecha ne be siikhasi nibo balekhuula, mala babareera mu bunyali bwabwe nga nasioobi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wako Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Yeremia ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ese Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli ndoma ndi, nakhola endakaano ne bakuuka benywe nga nabarusia mu sibala sia Misiri, munju eye bunasioobi. Naloma ndi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.21.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khur. 21.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 15.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ‘Enyuma we kimiiko sita buli mulala khwinywe akhoya alekhuule Omueburania wasie owakusibwa khwiwe nga nasioobi mala akhukholeele kimilimo kimiiko sita. Okhoya omulekhuule, arure khu milimo kiowo.’ Ne kakhali bakuuka benywe se bandekeeresia namwe bambulila tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enywe mwekanile embi ari busa mala mwakhola kali ka ng'ali mu moni mwase khulwe khulangilila bulekhuule, buli omundu aboolela owase, mala mwakhola endakaano ebweeni wase mu Lukaangu lwase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali luno enywe mwakaluukhane mala mwafwolobie lisina liase nga buli mulala khwinywe ne akoboosie nasioobi wewe owe siseecha nende owe siikhasi nibo mwaba ne mwalekhuula khuloondekhana ne liliekoomba liabwe. Ne mwabakoboosie mu bunyali bwenywe babe lundi nasioobi benywe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Enywe se mwandire ese khulwe khulangilila bulekhuule, buli mundu khu wandaaye ne khu wasie tawe. Lola ese ndalaangilila khwinywe bulekhuule bwe liie, bwe lufu, nende bwe njala. Khamukhole mubiilwe ne bubwami bwe khu sibala bwoosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne babaandu babafunaka endakaano yase, mala se baliinda ke ndakaano niyo bakhola ebweeni wase tawe, ndabakhola babe nga emoosi niyo babeene batonya mu bitonyi bibili mala babirira akari we bitonyi ebio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu bano bali babemeelesi ba Yuda, babemeelesi ba Yerusalemu, bakholi, basaayi ne babaandu boosi be mu sibala bababira akari we bitonyi bie moosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ese ndabaana mu bunyali bwe basiku babwe ne nabo babenya khubeera. Kimibili kiabwe kilaba siakhulia sie chinyuni ne chisaang'i ne chisolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndaana Sedekia omwami owa Yuda ne babemeelesi bewe khu basiku babwe, ne khwaabo bayiima khubeera. Ndabaelesia banamae ba Babiloni barekukhe balekha khumwibwaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Lola ndalaka, mala ndabakobosia mu lukoba luno mala balalwibwaakala, mala baluambe ne khulwosia. Ndakhola chingoba cha Yuda chanjukhwe chibe busa nga sisiangalaamwe nisio omundu yesi yesi akhamenyamo tawe. Ese, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nalomile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
